  description:
  - 
  leftText: 
  rightText: The membranes of this plant's stem and bud are permeable and thin. Instead
    most growth is directed to the roots, so that they may pull more moisture from
    the soil. The seeds lie dormant until conditions are favorable and water is abundant.
